# Declarations for the BCP 47 resource: empty.
#
# This set states nothing; only the resource's statements apply. The registry
# publishes no distinctness between primary subtags, so two constraints
# naming different languages are satisfiable together unless the
# distinctness rule is adopted (bcp47-distinct.ttl).
#
# Source: https://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry

@prefix bind:    <https://w3id.org/odrl-kb/binding#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://w3id.org/odrl-kb/bcp47/empty> a bind:Declarations ;
    dcterms:title "No declared distinctness"@en ;
    bind:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/odrl-kb/bcp47> ;
    bind:pairCount 0 .
